{"version":2,"memos":[{"id":"demo_guide","title":"使用指南","pinned":false,"createdAt":"2025-11-24T05:20:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2025-11-24T05:20:00.000Z","doc":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"dg1","children":[{"text":"这篇备忘演示常用手势与操作，边看边试，试完删掉即可。"}]},{"type":"heading","id":"dg2","children":[{"text":"左滑一行"}],"attrs":{"level":2}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"dg3","children":[{"text":"在备忘列表里左滑任意一行，可以置顶或删除。删除后 8 秒内，点屏幕底部提示里的「撤销」可以恢复。"}]},{"type":"heading","id":"dg4","children":[{"text":"长按拖拽排序"}],"attrs":{"level":2}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"dg5","children":[{"text":"在编辑页长按任意一块（约半秒）把它拾起，拖到目标位置放下即可排序。正在编辑的块长按是选择文字，不会拾起。"}]},{"type":"todo","id":"dg6","children":[{"text":"试一试：长按这行，把它拖到最上面"}],"attrs":{"checked":false}},{"type":"heading","id":"dg7","children":[{"text":"斜杠插入"}],"attrs":{"level":2}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"dg8","children":[{"text":"在空段落里输入 / ，可以插入标题、待办、图片、卡片等各种块。"}]},{"type":"heading","id":"dg9","children":[{"text":"双栏"}],"attrs":{"level":2}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"dg10","children":[{"text":"宽屏下打开编辑页菜单里的双栏开关，左右两栏可以各自混排、独立滚动。"}]},{"type":"heading","id":"dg11","children":[{"text":"搜索与备份"}],"attrs":{"level":2}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"dg12","children":[{"text":"点列表顶部的搜索胶囊，可以按标题和正文搜索；到设置页可以导出 ZIP 备份，换设备时再导入恢复。"}]}]},{"id":"demo_exhibit","title":"周末看展记录","pinned":false,"createdAt":"2025-11-24T05:20:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2025-11-24T05:20:00.000Z","doc":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"de1","children":[{"text":"今天去了 UCCA 的「非物质再现」展。光线透过亚克力板投射在墙上的影子会随着人的移动变化，站久了会忘记时间。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"de2","children":[{"text":"想起上周看的书里那句话：==所谓的边界，只是我们还没习惯的过渡带=="}]},{"type":"heading","id":"de3","children":[{"text":"实用信息"}],"attrs":{"level":2}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"de4","children":[{"text":"地址：798 艺术区 UCCA。票价 100 元。"}]}]},{"id":"demo_home","title":"装修踩坑清单","pinned":true,"createdAt":"2025-11-23T05:20:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2025-11-23T05:20:00.000Z","doc":[{"type":"todo","id":"dh1","children":[{"text":"厨房插座至少留 6 个，台面要带开关"}],"attrs":{"checked":true}},{"type":"todo","id":"dh2","children":[{"text":"卫生间防水刷到 1.8m，闭水试验做满 48h"}],"attrs":{"checked":true}},{"type":"todo","id":"dh3","children":[{"text":"地板和瓷砖之间用极窄收边条，不要过门石"}],"attrs":{"checked":false}},{"type":"todo","id":"dh4","children":[{"text":"衣柜做到顶，不要成品柜，顶部积灰严重"}],"attrs":{"checked":false}}]},{"id":"demo_tools","title":"好用的工具网站","pinned":false,"createdAt":"2025-11-21T05:20:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2025-11-21T05:20:00.000Z","doc":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"dt1","children":[{"text":"几个日常高频用到的小工具，免费无广告。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"dt2","children":[{"text":"Excalidraw — 画架构图和流程图最顺手的白板。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"dt3","children":[{"text":"Carbon — 把代码生成漂亮的分享图，支持 20+ 主题。"}]}]},{"id":"demo_book","title":"读书笔记｜设计的觉醒","pinned":false,"createdAt":"2025-11-17T05:20:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2025-11-17T05:20:00.000Z","doc":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"db1","children":[{"text":"田中一光的随笔集，断断续续读了一个月。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"db2","children":[{"text":"「设计不是一种技能，而是捕捉事物本质的感觉和洞察力。」"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"db3","children":[{"text":"「整理、排布、思考——设计的本质就是这三件事的循环。」"}]}]},{"id":"demo_music","title":"最近在听的歌","pinned":false,"createdAt":"2025-11-10T05:20:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2025-11-10T05:20:00.000Z","doc":[{"type":"heading","id":"dm1","children":[{"text":"上周循环最多的几首"}],"attrs":{"level":2}},{"type":"paragraph","id":"dm2","children":[{"text":"She Her Her Hers — Arrows — 吉他前奏一响整个人都松下来了。适合下雨天窝在沙发上单曲循环。"}]},{"type":"musicCard","id":"dm3","url":"https://c6.y.qq.com/base/fcgi-bin/u?__=1RE7gOYaMZgO","status":"loading","meta":null},{"type":"paragraph","id":"dm4","children":[{"text":"陶喆 — 月亮代表谁的心 — 晚上十一点半的地铁上听到这首歌，老歌新唱居然听出了不一样的味道。原来有些旋律不管过多少年都不会过期。"}]},{"type":"musicCard","id":"dm5","url":"https://music.apple.com/cn/album/%E6%9C%88%E4%BA%AE%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E8%B0%81%E7%9A%84%E5%BF%83/914664926?i=914664941","status":"loading","meta":null},{"type":"paragraph","id":"dm6","children":[{"text":"黑裙子 — Our Own Summer — 前奏的鼓点一出来就感觉回到了某个无所事事的夏天傍晚，风吹在脸上是热的，但心里是凉的。"}]},{"type":"musicCard","id":"dm7","url":"https://163cn.tv/7ceoWN8","status":"loading","meta":null},{"type":"paragraph","id":"dm8","children":[{"text":"落日飞车 — My Jinji — 适合晚上开车听，吉他音色软软的，像夏天的风从车窗缝里吹进来。"}]},{"type":"musicCard","id":"dm9","url":"https://open.spotify.com/track/7npPPrZEDmeHMk6mxvIeFa?si=zp0-QuSsTBWvhaGVKVUfjg","status":"loading","meta":null}]}]}